            <div xml:id="m-10a64215-f6b0-4739-8ab2-9ac430a7f20f">
              <lg xml:id="m-58d3d02d-6dd2-40c3-ba52-21dd63dab8af">
                <l xml:id="m-5de33031-c28e-435e-a040-a870865a3ad8" facs="#m-6f6039ff-ac50-4d3c-8ef2-d4a7dfb2ac58" label="ambiguous">Maundy Thursday</l><l xml:id="m-3a8f0a2a-7b4c-48e2-9815-821b65ea6009" facs="#m-ae1b304f-3fb2-492a-9f36-53d6b837ba09" label="ambiguous">802</l><l xml:id="m-84a5a16c-8028-40b8-ba65-d8f63a1a9a0b" facs="#m-4738b876-dc44-4e78-b141-84afc7a6a635" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Jacobi Apostoli. 5,13-16</l><l xml:id="m-d5405e7d-b580-4153-93e9-8cb9370a8cd3" facs="#m-69104f92-d6d4-42f0-ae13-4ee83b8dd425" label="lyrics-like">Ratres: Tristátur áliquis ve-infirmum, et alleviábit eum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c88b3d6e-5045-43fa-9f87-ee275f23a444" facs="#m-b82f50de-4e1b-44c8-acae-93e19fdcfe6f" label="lyrics-like">minus; et si in peccátis sit,</l><l xml:id="m-6436b31a-2a56-41dd-a597-ea4dd0a6a3f3" facs="#m-8a5e9425-597b-4c4d-adf0-22332b80ea5d" label="lyrics-like">strum? Oret. Æquo ánimo</l><l xml:id="m-2944e5c4-2474-4c17-b269-03f4165d2987" facs="#m-00a9c708-ecd7-4881-aa6f-3d19fdae198b" label="lyrics-like">est? Psallat. Infirmátur quis in</l><l xml:id="m-16f9c862-766d-451c-8f78-71aaae979cbe" facs="#m-8516c1f7-fe28-459c-8f8f-33f7cecfe559" label="lyrics-like">remitténtur ei. Conntémini ergo</l><l xml:id="m-fee1c1ea-ad44-45ec-ac28-ff7b8f380118" facs="#m-269bac7f-19ff-4164-bf90-bcef48ee2220" label="lyrics-like">altérutrum peccáta vestra, et</l><l xml:id="m-958f34d0-5183-46fc-996a-dcf7be47d570" facs="#m-8a7d9c9f-9b49-4ddb-8b56-5b73e86a0472" label="lyrics-like">vobis? Indúcat presbyteros ec¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2b12334-7f3b-414b-8b43-b8779bca33c6" facs="#m-472cd6d4-bedc-4888-9a00-03c54f8d62a5" label="lyrics-like">loráte pro invicem ut salvémini;</l><l xml:id="m-bf915820-2c5c-4fb9-8daf-0b9f8bbc7ff7" facs="#m-139ef62e-4e32-434e-9210-24057560bba9" label="lyrics-like">clésiae, et orent super eum,</l><l xml:id="m-771c911f-4c65-4b71-869e-57b861576044" facs="#m-ad622e0d-6e6b-4551-972e-2cbdb90e69b8" label="lyrics-like">ungéntes eum óleo in nómine! multum enim valet deprecátio</l><l xml:id="m-d17d6762-9d0b-4d01-8bd2-086121df17df" facs="#m-65530574-fe6c-47cd-937a-0b5807b86b34" label="lyrics-like">Dómini; et orátio fidei salvábit justi assidua.</l><l xml:id="m-f609e427-5093-4090-a4a3-8eae69f41b28" facs="#m-0735a73d-fa60-4612-b19e-963a8e7a0d04" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-c3f66dbb-b045-4c68-b6b3-4ea2ab134b57" facs="#m-ebad703c-0a1d-4611-b228-e2145f98dfeb" label="lyrics-like">um, et adjú¬</l><l xml:id="m-56220882-f67b-47b5-87ff-1793dc9c8cd9" facs="#m-430a71b8-caac-4b5a-ac9b-26d96a030372" label="lyrics-like">N Dé¬ o*confí-sum est cor mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3a21681-b1da-4f22-9412-a3a28289f572" facs="#m-607bf23f-2f8b-4af0-af65-7b5997dd12d7" label="ambiguous">tus sum;</l><l xml:id="m-dcb01c8b-e6ad-4b39-ac82-7675f5590c63" facs="#m-68409140-b4ac-42f2-9445-c76a8928c272" label="lyrics-like">Ide-o exsúl-tat cor mé-um,</l><l xml:id="m-8a8f0f34-55b5-468e-a14a-ad27c6bcc0e8" facs="#m-d34f8193-1f05-46d0-b30d-2bc00291b228" label="lyrics-like">láu-do</l><l xml:id="m-67ec835f-c539-4fe3-8c9b-3ed91604cf89" facs="#m-ffec0eab-9db9-46b1-bf23-45474ea62994" label="lyrics-like">é.</l><l xml:id="m-9469d4d3-7b38-4051-96b9-4f5f3970de38" facs="#m-6f76350e-b1a9-4c5d-bf29-b493c0655965" label="lyrics-like">et cánti-co mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-46d24a77-383a-4db1-b65b-58996b8bdd02" facs="#m-1fbc1e8e-280f-4f0a-abf1-a7e331606ad9" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-dade1f3a-20bd-418d-857f-e38fa1275926" facs="#m-baf105be-fcf0-439a-845d-7be56b4ed568" label="ambiguous">um.</l><l xml:id="m-fd90b91d-89c4-4bcf-bba3-3ab422516785" facs="#m-6124cf3e-85fe-4cc1-a7fa-437bd39e24e9" label="lyrics-like">robur est pópu-lo sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-1121f63b-94f8-4ebc-ba9c-e7fcbe6bc157" facs="#m-9108d927-634c-4b70-8df6-ad1982b7798f" label="ambiguous">et prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-ca234207-0056-4756-8d6d-47fae03e300b" facs="#m-73900855-db9e-4aab-8189-92db680b904d" label="lyrics-like">sí¬</l><l xml:id="m-90d72a80-7d00-4ecf-9979-55dc0cdd90f9" facs="#m-cf7b137a-8fcf-4bcf-a5a5-a0ed9d585089" label="ambiguous">di-um</l><l xml:id="m-b518d4f4-12f3-4846-82e9-bd7a663abac1" facs="#m-5cdd1611-9c38-4891-ad51-9c58db46f6a3" label="lyrics-like">sa-lú- tis</l><l xml:id="m-a6edd63e-1e00-43d0-a007-dafce9ba3e48" facs="#m-802dc5e9-9b99-4e45-88ac-fc89c4ec17fc" label="lyrics-like">úncto</l><l xml:id="m-4cf380fd-dc4a-4d3d-a800-6a6bd4071d2b" facs="#m-34d344e1-b9c1-40de-a327-a0509306aaf7" label="lyrics-like">sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c36b6dd-b7fb-4bc4-9bf9-f6b82ec5abf8" facs="#m-b6464c82-e358-4900-845e-d88fd4a791cc" label="ambiguous">o.</l><l xml:id="m-678feca0-16f6-49cd-b2b8-ded9dff0dbfd" facs="#m-fb37cd81-e65e-4a10-b78e-3ec5ace04951" label="ambiguous">+Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Marcum. 6, 7-13</l><l xml:id="m-cbc71f79-bc79-4ffa-8cae-5897d29fc251" facs="#m-3ff3919e-0973-45c6-b994-d0d084a13cc1" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Vocávit Jesus praecépit eis, ne quid tóllerent</l><l xml:id="m-5c49fc11-fb0f-4f5e-80c4-0b78e073d294" facs="#m-860a4dbb-c393-4d29-acbe-4c9ed51baf85" label="lyrics-like">A duódecim, et cœpit eos mit¬</l><l xml:id="m-c261bee9-ede3-41e4-a4ee-0b401296ab71" facs="#m-6d514e47-5708-4fe5-9096-13014136bdec" label="ambiguous">in via, nisi virgam tantum; non</l><l xml:id="m-bd36911e-d9b5-4bcf-a64a-3dc099756f12" facs="#m-c2858ab5-815c-4dfd-a561-16233d400913" label="lyrics-like">tere binos, et dabat illis potestá¬</l><l xml:id="m-6145950a-5678-4081-9fb0-90f894bbc64a" facs="#m-3449b1f6-e7f5-4694-8ec5-6e27c64f2f18" label="ambiguous">peram, non panem, neque in</l><l xml:id="m-12abd172-8f7f-40a9-bf1e-1b6e704ccc58" facs="#m-a7314abc-7931-4bef-b5c4-f94c8177ef78" label="lyrics-like">tem spirituum immundórum. Et lzona aes, sed calceátos sandáliis,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
